   "design": "Patients fill the intake form in the portal and the answers land in the record, instead of being copied from paper. Laboratory results arrive in the record by integration, instead of a separate portal login. With consent, a certified scribe drafts the history, findings and diagnosis, and the podiatrist corrects every draft. Reviewing, examining, x-rays, ordering, diagnosing and messages stay with the podiatrist. No model reads images or decides the diagnosis.",
   "approvals": [],
   "previous_blocker": "Intake answers were copied, results looked up and notes typed by hand.",
   "enabler_now": "Portal intake forms, laboratory integration and certified ambient scribes.",
   "still_hard": "Patients who decline recording or the portal.",
   "human_edge": "Feeling the joint that causes the pain.",
   "ambition": {
    "kind": "none",
    "what": ""
   },
   "altitude": "Less typing; examination stays.",
